@HostAddress = http://localhost:5080

### List rooms
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/rooms
Accept: application/json

### Filter rooms by capacity
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/rooms?minCapacity=6
Accept: application/json

### List users
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/users
Accept: application/json

### List reservations
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/reservations
Accept: application/json

###